<title>JAPAN: Daimaru Industrial - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daimaru Industrial - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.88		vs	    7.47</p>
<p> Operating	  154    million    vs	  141    million</p>
<p> Current	    182    million    vs	  166    million</p>
<p> Net		  133    million    vs	  104    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.23 yen	  vs	   14.27 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daimaru Industrial Company Limited sells fuel for home use.</p>
</text>
